g with 5 tiles for n=4? Let's list them:\n\n- Left side: rectangle A: rows3-4 columns1-2 (covers (3,1),(3,2),(4,1),(4,2)). rectangle B: row2 column1 (covers (2,1)).\n- Right side: rectangle C:",
